    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comedy and Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedy horror game about falling into the backrooms while trying to head to the store to find something to eat. You will need to find food and solve simple puzzles to survive and hopefully find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are puzzles but they are not progress haltingly difficult. There are notes and environmental hints alluding to the solutions. They're made to add to the game not add frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Iconic Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore iconic levels such as: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Poolrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburbia </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crimson Forrest and more</p></li></ul>",
